sequenceDiagram
    participant Kernel
    participant Loader as ld.so (dynamic loader)
    participant App as Application
    participant Lib as Shared Libraries
    
    Kernel->>Loader: exec() starts loader first
    Loader->>Loader: Read executable's .dynamic section
    Loader->>Loader: Parse DT_NEEDED entries
    Loader->>Lib: Load required libraries
    Lib-->>Loader: Libraries mapped into memory
    Loader->>Loader: Resolve symbols (PLT/GOT)
    Loader->>Loader: Relocations applied
    Loader->>App: Jump to entry point
    App->>App: main() executes
    
    Note over Loader,Lib: Search paths:, 1. RPATH/RUNPATH, 2. LD_LIBRARY_PATH, 3. /etc/ld.so.cache, 4. /lib, /usr/lib
